			"Hit table: the tip of \001Background and border\002 explains the thin red line that can show under a number in a fight. It is the bar of an enemy's nameplate far behind the table, seen through its see-through background. \001Own border and background\002 on the \001Minimap\002 page, with a higher \001Background opacity\002, makes the background more solid.",
