			"The target of target frame now sits just right of the target frame with their tops in line, no longer floating below and to the right, and the focus target sits beside the focus frame, in either \001Frame style\002. It goes with the target frame wherever \001/flatui move\002 puts it. The new \001Position\002 row on the \001Target of target frame\002 tab can leave it on the game's spot. It moves out of combat.",
			"Action bars: empty buttons are faint by default, as \001Empty buttons\002 (\001Faint\002) and \001Faint empty button opacity\002 (50%) say. Before, Edit Mode's \001Always show buttons\002, on at first, kept them at full, so a half-filled bar looked like a wall of empty boxes.",
